Annotates the last unannotated BE tick-overrides:
- CreakingHeartBlockEntity.serverTick — SERIALIZED (spawns Creaking, neighbor updates, sound)
- SculkCatalystBlockEntity.serverTick — SERIALIZED (sculk spread writes nearby blocks)
- CrafterBlockEntity.serverTick — CONTRACTIBLE (self inventory + crafting cooldown)
- SignBlockEntity.tick — CONTRACTIBLE (self-only NBT/wax)
- VaultBlockEntity.tick — SERIALIZED (spawns reward items, connects players)
Purely additive (65 insertions, 0 deletions). Compiles clean; BEs tick error-free.

